@startuml seq-06-x402
!include style.iuml
title x402 from the box: the daemon pays only what the proxy observed\nx402: none → observed → authorizing (or waiting) → authorized → handed → settled | expired | cancelled (C11, C14, C18, C19, C21)
autonumber "<b>0."

participant "Agent's code\nin the box" as Box
participant "Egress proxy\n(addon.py)" as Proxy
participant "x402 server\napi.weather.test" as Srv
participant "Facilitator" as Fac
participant "Agent Mara\n(model)" as Agent
participant "wallet~__pay_x402\n(EffectTool, daemon)" as Tool
database "Store" as Store
participant "Signer" as Signer
participant "RPC / Base" as Chain

Box -> Proxy : GET api.weather.test/v1/forecast?city=lisbon\n(login of chat C)
Proxy -> Srv : TLS; upstream certificate verified (ssl_insecure false)
Srv --> Proxy : 402, PAYMENT-REQUIRED (base64 JSON, x402Version 2)
Proxy -> Proxy : record observation O {chat C, origin, path, method,\nrequirements as received}
note right of Proxy
  Durable before the box sees it (C21). An unverified upstream
  gives 502 and no observation (banda-integration answer 7).
  row: x402 none · proxy_sees_402 [verified] → observed
end note
Proxy --> Box : 402 + x-banda-challenge: O
Box --> Agent : command output names challenge O
Agent -> Tool : wallet~__pay_x402 {challenge: O}
Tool -> Store : intake first: commit the Challenges doc (H-219)
Tool -> Store : admission commit
note right of Store
  O belongs to the calling chat (C18), https, unexpired, unpaid.
  x402Version 2, scheme exact, network = the wallet's; asset = pinned USDC;
  extra.name / version = the per-network table; EIP-3009 only, no signing
  extensions (Permit2, approvals); payTo not zero, the token or the wallet.
  Rule key: (wallet, Mara, origin and path, payTo, asset, network).
  Every term comes from O, none from the agent.
end note
alt rule Deny
  Store --> Tool : refused
  note right of Store : row: observed · call [same_chat and rule == 'deny'] → refused
else rule Ask
  Store --> Tool : Waiting: card "Pay Weather API 0.01 USDC?"
  note right of Store
    observed · call [same_chat and rule == 'ask' and fits] → waiting.
    An approval within 24 h signs with a window from chain time at approval (R-9):
    waiting · card_pay [window_left] → authorizing
  end note
else rule Always and it fits
  note right of Store : row: observed · call [same_chat and rule == 'always' and fits] → authorizing
else another chat names O
  Store --> Tool : refused: not this chat's observation
  note right of Store : row: observed · call [not same_chat] → observed (PaidByObservingChat)
end

Tool -> Chain : latest block timestamp c
Tool -> Store : authorization commit
note right of Store
  nonce = keccak256("banda/x402" | wallet | O), committed before any signature (R-5, C14);
  validAfter = min(c, wall) − 5 s; validBefore = max(c, wall) + min(maxTimeoutSeconds, 60 s) (C19);
  reservation until validBefore passes or an event is seen (C11).
  row: authorizing · authorization_commit [rule != 'deny' and (rule == 'always' or approved) and fits] → authorized
end note
Tool -> Signer : signTransferWithAuthorization(message, domain from the table)
Signer --> Tool : signature (deterministic: a crash re-derives the same one)
Tool -> Store : store the signature; hand the header
Tool --> Box : PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header (only the signature enters the box)
note right of Tool : row: authorized · hand_header [synced] → handed

Box -> Proxy : retry GET with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE
Proxy -> Srv : (a paid retry of a held write needs a pass: open)
Srv -> Fac : verify, settle
Fac -> Chain : transferWithAuthorization (the facilitator pays the gas)
Srv --> Box : 200 + PAYMENT-RESPONSE (a claim, not the outcome)

loop follower, until a final event or validBefore passes at finalized
  Tool -> Chain : eth_getLogs AuthorizationUsed / AuthorizationCanceled;\nauthorizationState(wallet, nonce)
end
alt AuthorizationUsed, finalized
  Tool -> Store : settled; reservation released
  note right of Store : row: handed · follow [event == 'used' and event_fin] → settled
else AuthorizationCanceled, finalized
  Tool -> Store : cancelled
  note right of Store : row: handed · follow [event == 'cancelled' and event_fin] → cancelled
else no event and validBefore passed, finalized
  Tool -> Store : expired; reservation released (a retry is a new payment)
  note right of Store : row: handed · follow [event == 'none' and vb_passed_fin] → expired (F-5)
end
note over Box, Chain
  Two calls for one observation give one authorization: the derived nonce, which the token accepts once (C14, H-227);
  rows: authorized · agent_pays_again → authorized, handed · agent_pays_again → handed. An endpoint whose payTo changed
  since its rule was set asks again. The x402 SDK is never on the payer path (R-6).
end note
@enduml
